msgid "``raw_roc_available``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/ad9910.rst:701
msgid ""
"Lists the available ``raw_roc`` values based on the current "
"``sampling_frequency``. The first value is always ``0`` (disabled) and the "
"last value corresponds to pin-controlled immediate mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/ad9910.rst:707
msgid ""
"OSK ramp clock. Controlled by an integer divider; the written value is "
"adjusted to the nearest supported rate."
