"``adi,pll-enable`` devicetree property), configures the PLL multiplier "
"(Range: :math:`[420, 1000]` MHz). Without PLL, the reference clock can only "
"be divided by 2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/ad9910.rst:762
msgid ""
"Full-scale DAC output current per amplitude code LSB, which is evaluated "
"as :math:`I_{FS} / 2^{14}`. Shared across all ``altcurrent`` channels. "
"Setting this attribute reconfigures the auxiliary DAC full-scale code and "
"updates the effective amplitude resolution for single tone profiles, DRG "
"amplitude ramps and OSK."
